ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" VitalSigns : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningBreastBiopsyProcedure : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "0..1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningDiagnosticReport : « subject »
ScreeningPatient "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningSpecimen : « subject »
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningObservation : « result »
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "1" ScreeningSpecialTreatmentObservation : « supportingInfo.reference »
ScreeningDiagnosticReport "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningObservation "0..*" --> "0..1" ScreeningServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningSpecimen "0..*" --> "0..*" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « request »
ScreeningBreastBiopsyServiceRequest "1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest : « basedOn »
ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest "0..1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningBreastCytologyObservation : « basedOn »
ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest "0..1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation : « basedOn »
ScreeningPathologyServiceRequest "0..1" <-- "0..*" ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation : « basedOn »
ScreeningImmunohistochemistryObservation "0..*" -[norank]-> "1..*" ScreeningBreastHistologyObservation : « derivedFrom »
ScreeningObservation -[hidden]-> ScreeningMammographyObservation
ScreeningObservation -[hidden]-> ScreeningBreastUltrasoundObservation
ScreeningObservation -[hidden]-> ScreeningCervicalHistologyObservation
ScreeningPatient -[hidden]-> ScreeningPractitioner

note "Har bir kuzatuv (Observation) va yo'llanma (ServiceRequest)\n« subject » orqali bemorga ham havola qiladi" as N1
N1 .. ScreeningObservation

caption Klinik graf: diagramma o'qilishi oson bo'lishi uchun tashkilotlar, tibbiyot xodimlari va boshqa ishtirokchilarga havolalar ko'rsatilmagan.\nSkriningni birlashtiruvchi yakuniy hujjat ScreeningComposition ko'rsatilmagan.

